  "description": {
    "text": "The 2025 Pokémon World Championships, held from 15 to 17 August 2025 at the Anaheim Convention Center in California. Competitors got Paradise Resort with new art by Naoki Saito, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing.\n\nThe top four of each of the card game's Junior, Senior and Masters divisions received No. 1 to No. 4 Trainer trophy cards.",
